eceding insult an example of a greeting that has fallen below the expected standard.\n\n**Conclusion:** The sarcasm lies in using the word "greetings" to refer to the insult, thereby implying that greetings are *supposed* to be polite.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{D}$
