e audio is that the person was standing "right here." Choice A incorporates this phrase ("he was standing right here"). Although the dialogue doesn't explicitly state "outside," the context of the first speaker waking up and "looking out" suggests the location being discussed is external or visible from a window/doorway. Given the options, Choice A is the closest match to the direct quote provided by Speaker 2.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
